               <title>HOW SUPPLIED</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Lidexa™ (Lidocaine Hydrochloride 38.8 mg/g) is supplied as a white topical cream in a 3 oz (85 g) tube.<br/>
                     <br/>
NDC 85477-330-07</paragraph>
               </text>
